  "post_content": "<p>80 fotos d&#39;aquest dimarts a la 32&ordf; Fira del Llibre d&#39;Onda, que t&eacute; bona pedrera, ja que l&#39;alumnat de 1er. d&#39;ESO ha mantingut un encontre amb l&#39;actor, director i productor Carles Alberola Ortiz sobre la seua obra teatral Joan, el Cendr&oacute;s.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/05/IMG_2717.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Mentrestant han continuat les visites de l&#39;alumnat de Prim&agrave;ria al recinte firal i a la bilioteca infantil on es realitza l&#39;espectacle de narraci&oacute; oral coneixent Gloria Fuertes.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsfirallibreonda17/img_2660.jpg\" alt=\"img_2660\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsfirallibreonda17/img_2661.jpg\" alt=\"img_2661\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsfirallibreonda17/img_2662.jpg\" alt=\"img_2662\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsfirallibreonda17/img_2663.jpg\" alt=\"img_2663\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsfirallibreonda17/img_2664.jpg\" alt=\"img_2664\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsfirallibreonda17/img_2665.jpg\" alt=\"img_2665\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsfirallibreonda17/img_2666.jpg\" alt=\"img_2666\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/dimartsfirallibreonda17/img_2667.jpg\" alt=\"img_2667\" style=\"max-width:100%;height: